<title>SINGAPORE: Electronic Resources gets nod for Shanghai.</title>
<headline>Electronic Resources gets nod for Shanghai.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic Resources Ltd said on Tuesday it had obtained approval from authorities in China to open a representative office in Shanghai.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the office would be for Electronic Resources China Ltd, a wholly-owned subsidiary incorporated in HongKong.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
